"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"감기에","meaning":"感冒","explanation":"감기：感冒；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28635","senseId":"1","lemma":"감기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감기에","audio":"/audio/b758d0ed4f382a0f8653.mp3"}},{"text":"걸린","meaning":"患","explanation":"걸리다：患；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"8","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸린","audio":"/audio/bac9d72ba0598d97e24c.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"be887a88aedd126c","term":"콜록콜록","zh":"吭吭","audio":"/audio/be887a88aedd126cb1f9.mp3","entryId":"81284","definition":"不断从胸口发出的咳嗽声。","pronunciation":["콜록콜록"]},{"id":"aa2351b107c95734","term":"기침","zh":"咳嗽","audio":"/audio/aa2351b107c957346a08.mp3","entryId":"38465","definition":"空气从肺部通过喉咙突然喷出来，同时发出粗声。","pronunciation":["기침"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"以某种方式构成行为。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"以